{"asset_key":"ep6/quest_story_16201120","episode":"ep6","category":"quest_story","story_id":"16201120","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1620112001:1":{"text":"안녕하세요! 혹시 요즘 이 근처에서 이상한 사람 본 적 있으세요?","source_cn":"你好！请问你最近有没有见过什么奇怪的人？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF41EE795E5CD0977","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1620112002:1":{"text":"밤마다 몰래 들어와서 무덤 위에서 폴짝폴짝 뛰어다닌다거나요.","source_cn":"比如，经常在夜晚闯进来，然后在坟墓上蹦来蹦去之类的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDD8086B9C5025DAF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1620112003:1":{"text":"없어요.","source_cn":"没有。<key:dialog2>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBDC5DEFD0EB694FD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1620112004:1":{"text":"그럴 리가... 잘 생각해 보세요. 대략 한 달 전부터 그랬어요!","source_cn":"怎么会呢？您再好好回忆一下……大概就是一个月前开始的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCEA86BDFA80DB926","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1620112005:1":{"text":"반년 동안 이곳에서 근무했지만, 한밤중에 묘지에 들어와서 그런 몰상식한 짓을 하는 사람은 없었어요.","source_cn":"我已经在这里呆了大半年了。我很确定，最近没有人在晚上闯...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x398D1C9DA9B46E4E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1620112006:1":{"text":"그럼 한 달 동안 공동묘지에 이상한 일은 없었나요?","source_cn":"那最近一个月，墓园里就没有什么其他的怪事发生吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6B64CDCFD380BBD3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1620112007:1":{"text":"굳이 말하자면... <style=\"highlight\">고양이 울음소리</style>가 들렸죠. 시끄러워서 자다가 몇 번이나 깼어요.","source_cn":"硬要说的话……最近晚上总是有<style=highli...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x288932E750D1BF87","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1620112008:1":{"text":"고양이 울음소리... 설마 교수님의 무덤에서 소란을 피운 건 고양이가 아닐까요?","source_cn":"猫叫……难道在教授坟墓上作乱的，其实是调皮的猫吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3EB92F6404B05C9A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1620112009:1":{"text":"치피 생각에는 아닌 거 같아요. 그냥 고양이였다면 교수님이 한 번도 못 봤을 리가 없잖아요.","source_cn":"满满觉得不是。如果真的只是猫的话，教授怎么可能一次都没...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3CD7372A89D755E2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1620112010:1":{"text":"맞아요! 교수님이 슉! 하고 관에서 튀어나오는 속도가 얼마나 빠른데요. 고양이 한 마리 못 잡을 리가 없어요.","source_cn":"我作证！她出现速度那么快，唰得一下就从棺材里冒出来，不...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x68143E4404A2ECD2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1620112011:1":{"text":"네? 누가 관에서 튀어나온다고요?","source_cn":"你们说什么，谁从棺材里冒出来？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE2BF7248B8A1BC3E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1620112012:1":{"text":"윽... 그게... 잘못 말한 거예요. 교수님은 사실 관 뒤쪽 풀숲에서 나오셨어요. 하하... 풀, 풀숲에서요!","source_cn":"呃……那个……刚刚我说错了，教授其实是从棺材后的草丛里...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFD0F23C8BB524186","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1620112013:1":{"text":"그게 더 수상하지 않나요...","source_cn":"听起来更可疑了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x607518736182AB2C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1620112014:1":{"text":"오, 유령을 봤군요?","source_cn":"哦，你们看到的是幽灵啊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2CE25A145EAA3560","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:25:1620112014":{"text":"오, 유령을 봤군요?","source_cn":"哦，你们看到的是幽灵啊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2CE25A145EAA3560","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1620112015:1":{"tex